  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Squid accepted a bare 'Transfer-Encoding: identity' header,\n     which HTTP/1.1 forbids, allowing message framing confusion and request\n     smuggling\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61642.patch: Remove the identity special case in\n       HttpHeader::parse so a bare Transfer-Encoding: identity is treated as\n       unsupported and rejected\n     - CVE-2026-61642",
